# KaTeX's Unicode tables

The Unicode data KaTeX 0.19.1's parser consults: precomposed accented letters and their
decomposition (`unicodeSymbols.js`), combining accents and the commands they stand for
(`unicodeAccents.js`), Unicode sub- and superscript characters (`unicodeSupOrSub.ts`) and the script
blocks it supports in text (`unicodeScripts.ts`). Generated by `tools/gen-tables.mjs` from KaTeX
0.19.1; do not edit by hand.

